<title>CHINA: Morgan Stanley sets Hang Seng-China index warrants.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets Hang Seng-China index warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd</p>
<p>said on Tuesday it has issued 340 million call warrants on the</p>
<p>Hang Seng China-Affiliated Corp Index.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$3,175.24  PREMIUM	  23.70 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.1919    GEARING	  3.48x</p>
<p> MATURITY	   29.JUN.98    PAYMENT DATE   11.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG    LISTING DATE   14.AUG.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$3,342.36  BOARD LOT	5,000</p>
<p>NOTE - PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR IN CASH AT THE OPTION OF ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
